  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UCPCO - Strengthening the Capacity for Organic Coffee Production, Certification and Marketing among Small and Medium Producers of San Juan del Ro Coco and Telpaneca</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UCPCO will increase the income and quality of life of farmers in Madriz by improving their ability to produce and export certified fair-trade and organic coffee. It will provide the farmers financial and technical assistance and equipment, will construct an office and a store, and will improve its processing plant to include a quality control laboratory, a drying patio and a storage facility.</narrative>
  </description>
